---
import RuLayout from '../../layouts/RuLayout.astro';
const cases = [
  ['01','AUTHORITY CROSSING','Declared local-only authority дошла до synced storage.','Bounded executor должен был оставаться local, но evidence показал write в synced storage.','Effect classification перенесён в trusted preflight/broker вместо caller self-label.'],
  ['02','FALSE RECEIPT','No-effect receipt противоречил observed action record.','Return утверждал отсутствие external effect, а отдельный evidence показывал writes/mutations.','Terminal truth опирается на machine-derived ledgers и recomputable manifests, не narrative self-attestation.'],
  ['03','REPAIR BYPASS','Первый repair всё ещё доверял caller-controlled effect semantics.','Caller мог дать benign label, не совпадающий с реальной operation semantics.','Typed operation → trusted registry → broker-derived effect class → exact approval binding → handler → effect ledger.']
];
const antigravity=[['REQUESTS','46'],['DENIED','45'],['ALLOWED CONTROL','1 bounded READ_LOCAL'],['DENIED HANDLER DISPATCH','0'],['EXTERNAL HANDLER DISPATCH','0'],['UNCAUGHT EXCEPTIONS','0'],['TERMINAL LEDGER ROWS','46']];
const spark=[['5,400','adversarial authority requests'],['24 / 25','mutation kills · 96% in that batch'],['10,000','synthetic event ledgers'],['1,000','deliberately corrupted summaries'],['100%','detection in that batch'],['12,000','authority state-space scenarios'],['105','attack patterns'],['45','source-binding feature rows validated']];
---
<RuLayout title="Internal Dogfood Self-Audit — русский redacted case | BitEvo" description="Русская redacted версия внутреннего BitEvo self-audit: реальные bounded authority/evidence failures, repairs и retests без customer/certification claims." enPath="/dogfood-self-audit" ruPath="/ru/dogfood-self-audit">
<section class="section hero"><div class="container split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Internal self-audit</div><h1 class="display">Сначала мы прогнали метод по собственной authority stack.</h1><p class="lede">До внешнего предложения Audit BitEvo использовал метод на своих agent/control workflows: нашли bounded failures, отвергли слабые repairs, провели дополнительные repair cycles и retest.</p></div><aside class="receipt panel"><div><span>PROOF CLASS</span><strong>INTERNAL SELF-AUDIT</strong></div><div><span>customer_case</span><strong>false</strong></div><div><span>independent_certification</span><strong>false</strong></div><div><span>production_wide_security_claim</span><strong>false</strong></div><div><span>publication</span><strong>redacted / bounded</strong></div></aside></div></section>
<section class="section-tight section-rule"><div class="container claim panel"><strong>CLAIM CEILING</strong><p>Это internal dogfood program. Не customer evidence, не independent certification, не universal no-bypass, не provider-wide enforcement и не proof of fleet-wide production adoption.</p></div></section>
<section class="section section-rule"><div class="container split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Executive summary</div><h2 class="section-title">Ценным был не PASS, а способность поймать собственные ложные предположения.</h2></div><p class="lede">Мы наблюдали authority crossing, contradictory effect receipts и repair, который сам можно было обойти через caller-controlled semantics. Поэтому narrated success не принимался как closure без retest evidence.</p></div></section>
<section class="section section-rule"><div class="container case-grid">{cases.map(([n,label,title,observed,repair])=><article class="panel"><div class="top"><span>{n}</span><small>{label}</small></div><h3>{title}</h3><div class="row"><span>OBSERVED</span><p>{observed}</p></div><div class="row"><span>CONTROL DIRECTION</span><p>{repair}</p></div></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="section section-rule"><div class="container split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Bounded Antigravity contract</div><h2 class="section-title">TYPED_EFFECT_BROKER_EXCEPTION_BOUNDARY_PASS</h2><p class="lede">Это результат конкретного bounded batch, не universal enforcement claim.</p></div><div class="metrics">{antigravity.map(([k,v])=><div><span>{k}</span><strong>{v}</strong></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section section-rule"><div class="container split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Spark scoped batch</div><h2 class="section-title">Большой adversarial/evidence batch — с явным scope.</h2></div><div class="spark">{spark.map(([n,label])=><div><strong>{n}</strong><span>{label}</span></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section section-rule"><div class="narrow"><div class="eyebrow">What changed operationally</div><h2 class="section-title">Return status — claim до adjudication.</h2><p class="lede">Artifact integrity, runtime proof, semantic proof, adversarial proof и production adoption остаются разными gates. Local/shadow control не выдаётся за fleet-wide enforcement.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/ru/proof">Proof Matrix →</a><a class="button" href="/ru/audit-intake">Подготовить scope</a></div></div></section>
</RuLayout>
<style>.hero{padding-top:clamp(68px,9vw,118px)}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(38px,7vw,96px);align-items:start}.receipt{padding:22px}.receipt>div,.metrics>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.receipt span,.metrics span{color:var(--muted);font:500 .55rem var(--mono)}.receipt strong,.metrics strong{font:600 .66rem var(--mono);text-align:right}.claim{padding:20px 24px;border-color:rgba(215,197,143,.25)}.claim>strong{color:var(--gold);font:500 .62rem var(--mono)}.claim p{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}.case-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}.case-grid article{padding:24px;min-height:360px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.top span{color:var(--green);font:500 .6rem var(--mono)}.top small{color:var(--muted);font:500 .55rem var(--mono)}.case-grid h3{margin:45px 0 20px;font-size:1.15rem}.row{padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.row span{color:var(--green);font:500 .54rem var(--mono)}.row p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.77rem}.spark{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.spark>div{padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.spark strong{font-size:1.5rem}.spark span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.72rem}.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}@media(max-width:900px){.split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.case-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:620px){.case-grid,.spark{grid-template-columns:1fr}.receipt strong{text-align:left}.receipt>div{flex-direction:column;gap:4px}}</style>
